{"id":"u-f6a3f834-4e1e-4c07-bd96-bc8dda251752","src":"community","title":"FORGE 8: Strength Rebuild","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/EkY62n-forge-8-strength-rebuild","desc":"FORGE 8 is an 8 week, 4 days per week strength program built for people who are ready to get serious about becoming stronger again. Whether you're returning to training, rebuilding your foundation, or trying to break through a plateau, this program gives you a clear path forward without requiring you to live in the gym.\n\nThe program combines proven strength fundamentals, progressive overload, focused accessory work, and planned recovery to help you rebuild strength, add muscle, improve performance, and regain your confidence. Each week builds on the last so you always know what to train, what to improve, and what you're working toward.\n\nNo random workouts. No unnecessary complexity. Just four focused training days each week, measurable progression, and eight weeks to see how much stronger you can become.\n\nShow up. Put in the work. Finish stronger than you started.","level":["Novice","Beginner"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-22T00:08:38.115Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Monday : Squat + Bench","Wednesday : Deadlift + Back","Friday : Quads + Shoulders","Saturday Bench + Back"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbe